== Trivia ==
* [[anti:Eraser|Eraser]] originates from the ''Antibirth'' mod. In ''Antibirth'', this item was single use and wouldn't permanently remove an erased boss from the run, but could kill any boss in one hit.
** The Pickup quote was "Erase your enemies!".
* This item's effect is similar to the scroll of genocide that appears in traditional roguelikes such as ''NetHack'', originating in the ''Hack'' variant ''Hack121''.

